---
title: "HNTD search: from the form to the shortlist"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: waiting
    lg1: running
    lg2: done
    lg3: failed
    lg4: gone
  }
  class lg0 tan
  class lg1 blue
  class lg2 teal
  class lg3 orange
  class lg4 purple
  s0: No search yet
  s1: In queue
  s2: Deleted
  s3: Processing
  s4: Completed, shortlist shown
  s5: Deleted, the pipeline still works on it
  s6: Failed
  s7: In queue, a run that lost the claim still works
  s8: Processing, the run that holds it is gone
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: you start a search
  s1 --> s3: a pipeline run claims it
  s3 --> s4: the run delivers the shortlist
  s3 --> s5: you delete the search
  s3 --> s6: the run reports a failure
  s3 --> s7: the watchdog requeues it [30 minutes in processing] or you reset it from the terminal
  s3 --> s8: the Claude Code session ends mid-run
  s4 --> s1: you reset it from the terminal
  s5 --> s2: the run's next write is refused [claim lost], it stops or the Claude Code session ends mid-run
  s6 --> s1: you reset it from the terminal
  s7 --> s1: the run's next write is refused [claim lost], it stops or the Claude Code session ends mid-run
  s8 --> s1: the watchdog requeues it [30 minutes in processing] or you reset it from the terminal
  class s0 tan
  class s1 tan
  class s2 purple
  class s3 blue
  class s4 teal
  class s5 purple
  class s6 orange
  class s7 tan
  class s8 blue
